WEBVTT

00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:02.900
Are you a SMART fella,

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:04.933
or a FART smella?

00:00:04.933 --> 00:00:06.433
Let's find OUT!

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:09.367
Check this out,

00:00:09.367 --> 00:00:11.167
a word analogy!

00:00:11.167 --> 00:00:13.533
Happy is to sad,

00:00:13.533 --> 00:00:15.900
as fast is to...

00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:16.500
what?

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:17.100
A.

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:17.700
Slow,

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:18.300
B.

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:18.867
Quick,

00:00:18.867 --> 00:00:19.467
C.

00:00:19.467 --> 00:00:20.067
Race,

00:00:20.067 --> 00:00:21.267
or D.

00:00:21.267 --> 00:00:21.867
Sleep?

00:00:21.867 --> 00:00:23.033
Five seconds!

00:00:28.833 --> 00:00:30.033
TIME'S UP!

00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:31.167
It's...

00:00:31.167 --> 00:00:31.633
A,

00:00:31.633 --> 00:00:32.133
slow!

00:00:32.133 --> 00:00:34.467
Happy and sad are opposites,

00:00:34.467 --> 00:00:37.300
so the opposite of fast is

00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:37.800
slow.

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:40.633
It is the same relationship, flipped.

00:00:41.767 --> 00:00:42.300
Okay,

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:43.867
a number series!

00:00:43.867 --> 00:00:44.400
Two,

00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:44.933
six,

00:00:44.933 --> 00:00:45.433
eighteen,

00:00:45.433 --> 00:00:45.967
fifty-four,

00:00:45.967 --> 00:00:47.033
and then...

00:00:47.033 --> 00:00:48.600
what comes next?

00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:49.133
A.

00:00:49.133 --> 00:00:50.700
One hundred eight,

00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:51.233
B.

00:00:51.233 --> 00:00:52.800
One hundred sixty-two,

00:00:52.800 --> 00:00:53.333
C.

00:00:53.333 --> 00:00:54.900
One hundred fifty,

00:00:54.900 --> 00:00:55.933
or D.

00:00:55.933 --> 00:00:57.533
Two hundred sixteen?

00:00:57.533 --> 00:00:58.567
Five seconds!

00:01:04.367 --> 00:01:05.567
TIME'S UP!

00:01:06.233 --> 00:01:07.867
The answer is...

00:01:07.867 --> 00:01:08.400
B,

00:01:08.400 --> 00:01:10.033
one hundred sixty-two!

00:01:10.033 --> 00:01:13.267
Each number is multiplied by three:

00:01:13.267 --> 00:01:13.800
two,

00:01:13.800 --> 00:01:14.333
six,

00:01:14.333 --> 00:01:14.900
eighteen,

00:01:14.900 --> 00:01:15.433
fifty-four,

00:01:15.433 --> 00:01:18.667
so fifty-four times three is one

00:01:18.667 --> 00:01:19.767
hundred sixty-two.

00:01:20.900 --> 00:01:21.900
Here's one,

00:01:21.900 --> 00:01:23.433
a shape puzzle!

00:01:23.433 --> 00:01:25.433
Which shape comes next?

00:01:25.433 --> 00:01:25.933
A.

00:01:25.933 --> 00:01:26.933
A pentagon,

00:01:26.933 --> 00:01:27.433
B.

00:01:27.433 --> 00:01:28.467
A circle,

00:01:28.467 --> 00:01:28.967
C.

00:01:28.967 --> 00:01:29.967
A hexagon,

00:01:29.967 --> 00:01:30.967
or D.

00:01:30.967 --> 00:01:31.967
A square?

00:01:31.967 --> 00:01:32.967
Five seconds!

00:01:38.767 --> 00:01:39.967
TIME'S UP!

00:01:40.633 --> 00:01:42.067
The answer is...

00:01:42.067 --> 00:01:42.567
A,

00:01:42.567 --> 00:01:43.533
a pentagon!

00:01:43.533 --> 00:01:46.433
The sides count down by one:

00:01:46.433 --> 00:01:47.400
octagon eight,

00:01:47.400 --> 00:01:48.367
heptagon seven,

00:01:48.367 --> 00:01:49.333
hexagon six,

00:01:49.333 --> 00:01:52.233
so next is the pentagon with

00:01:52.233 --> 00:01:53.200
five sides.

00:01:54.333 --> 00:01:54.733
So,

00:01:54.733 --> 00:01:56.767
are you smart or fart?

00:01:56.767 --> 00:01:59.200
Count up your correct answers to

00:01:59.200 --> 00:02:00.400
find your rank!

00:02:01.567 --> 00:02:01.900
So,

00:02:01.900 --> 00:02:03.300
how did you do?

00:02:03.300 --> 00:02:04.667
Comment your score below,

00:02:04.667 --> 00:02:06.033
and follow for more!
